<title>UK: Gecc prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Gecc prices 200 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by</p>
<p>lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.46    PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.785    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	  AAA	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
