<p>DENOMS (K) 5-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT DEC 2007 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR AND UNSECURED.</p>
